  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mrow> </math><br />Taking dot product with <math> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </math> , we get,<br /><math> <mrow> <mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>⇒</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo></mrow> </math> <math> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mtext>As</mtext><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </mfenced><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mn>..</mn><mfenced> <mtext>i</mtext> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />Taking dot product with <math> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </math> , we get,&nbsp;<br /><math> <mrow> <mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>−</mo><msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>⇒</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>=</mo><msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mn>..</mn><mfenced> <mrow> <mtext>ii</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />Taking dot product with <math> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </math> , we get,&nbsp;<br /><math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"> <mtr> <mtd> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mtd> <mtd> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mtd> <mtd> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable></mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"> <mtr> <mtd> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mtd> <mtd> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mtd> <mtd> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable></mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mn>..</mn><mfenced> <mrow> <mtext>iii</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo><msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>c</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo><msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo>→</mo> </mover> <mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\">